{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09222","headline":"荅裴丞说归京所献 · 韦应物","name":"荅裴丞说归京所献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"执事颇勤久，行去亦伤乖。\n家贫无僮仆，吏卒升寝斋。\n衣服藏内箧，药草曝前阶。\n谁复知次第，濩落且安排。\n还期在岁晏，何以慰吾怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}